### Sprint 3 Edwin - Valid test-drive booking notification trigger
POST http://localhost:5500/api/test-drives
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Customer Name",
  "customerEmail": "customer@example.com",
  "vehicleName": "Toyota Land Cruiser",
  "appointmentDate": "2026-07-15",
  "appointmentTime": "10:00",
  "phone": "+256 770 826 951",
  "notes": "Customer prefers morning appointment."
}

### Expected response
# 201 Created
# Test-drive appointment confirmed.
# notification.attempted should be true.
# notification.sent may be false while provider transport is not connected.
# Provider secrets must not appear in the response.

